  "distance_km": 11.2,
  "description": "This walk takes you from Reigate Hill to Box Hill Country Park along the North Downs Way. The walk runs for about 7 miles along an elevated, undulating path offering fine views over the rolling hills of the North Downs.  You start off at the car park at Gatton, just east of Reigate Hill. From here you can pick up the waymarked trail and follow it west to Reigate Hill where there's chalk download, woodland trails and grassland with wildflowers in the summer. You continue west toColley Hilland Brockham Hill before finishing at the Box Hill visitor centre and car park. The park has miles of excellent walking and cycling trails with more wonderful views from the various viewpoints.",
